                                "sense_id": "a477ae5c-d30e-3b8a-bf1d-7c3657c6e209",
                                "text": "The xiphihumeralis muscle (M. xiphihumeralis) is the fourth muscle the pectoralis group ^([sic]). It originates from the xiphoid process of the sternum and inserts on the humerus (hence the name xiphihumeralis)."
